# Portfolio

Personal Angular 22 SSR portfolio. Live hero is `HomeComponent` (`src/app/pages/home`). Content: `me.json` / `seo.json`. Design tokens come from `layers-ui` plus `src/styles`.

## Do

- Keep SEO resolver + absolute social/canonical URLs working on every page change.
- Prefer lean, modern Angular 22 patterns (`inject`, signals, route `title`/`resolve`).

## Don't

- Do not revive `intro-banner` or unused CTA/meta hero chrome unless explicitly requested.
- Do not commit secrets or change Firebase project IDs without being asked.
